this is how JIT synth is gonna work:
jit input: JS
target: PHP

take JS seed. from JS seed, we construct JIT Constraint Templates -> to be referred to as JCT

JCTs will encode CFG shape. Function shape. Object shape. Type coercion. SSA properties (value reusage)

Control region: type 
        data op
        data op
        data op
        Control Region:
                data op
data op

Control regions are populated by data elements
